# API origin (no trailing slash). Required for production builds on Vercel.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api-project.vercel.app
#
# Local options:
# - Leave unset → `npm run dev` proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:3000 (run `vercel dev` in backend).
# - Set VITE_USE_REMOTE_API=true if you want localhost to bypass the proxy and call the deployed API directly.
# - Use .env.local with VITE_API_BASE_URL set → UI talks to deployed API only (see .env.local template in repo or create manually).
